### Deposit Cash
POST http://localhost:8083/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": 1001,
  "asset": "CASH",
  "amount": "10000.00"
}

### Settle a Trade
POST http://localhost:8083/settle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trade_id": 10001,
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": "150.00",
  "quantity": "10",
  "buyer_fee": "1.50",
  "seller_fee": "1.50",
  "maker_order_id": 1,
  "taker_order_id": 2,
  "maker_account_id": 1002,
  "taker_account_id": 1001,
  "buyer_account_id": 1001,
  "seller_account_id": 1002
}

### Get Audit Ledger
GET http://localhost:8083/ledger?account_id=1001

### Get Portfolio
GET http://localhost:8083/portfolio?account_id=1001

### Get PnL
GET http://localhost:8083/pnl?account_id=1001
